(text "4-bit DAC for DVB-T from the PIO (experiments/dvbt): GPIO22..25 = header pins 15, 16, 18, 22 (LSB first). GND = pin 14 (20 also GND)." (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d2f1a9d9-7271-437c-bfe7-f9381fa998ac"))
(text "Binary-weighted 1% resistors into one summing node. Large values so the GPIO's own ~40 ohm drive impedance only shifts the weights ~2-3% (fine: sim shows 3% costs < 1 dB)." (at 25.4 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "12c95d16-1568-44f3-be16-90000af9a04f"))
(text "TIMING SKEW BETWEEN THE 4 BITS IS WHAT MATTERS (the TV channel is the 14th image at 474 MHz: 100 ps = 17 deg): keep all four leads short and EQUAL length," (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d80ad6e4-e8da-40d5-a66d-8db7bed971c7"))
(text "resistors right at the header, summing node 1-2 cm away. Sim: <= 50 ps skew -> MER ~14-18 dB, 100 ps -> 9-13 dB, 200 ps -> ~5-8 dB (QPSK 1/2 needs ~5)." (at 25.4 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "68a906b0-d69a-47b6-92e3-8118ec29611f"))
(text "L1 + C1: high-pass, removes the strong 3.5-11 MHz baseband signal (~ -13 dBm) before the tuner; C1 also blocks DC (some TVs/boxes feed 5 V to the aerial)." (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9cad2adb-362d-4771-8e0e-78e7cc832977"))
(text "L1: 4 turns of 0.5 mm wire on a 3 mm drill. Expected level at 474 MHz: roughly -50 dBm (unmeasured). The tuner input (75 ohm) is the load." (at 25.4 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c4c52c4b-2858-4b09-8c6b-689c14c84928"))
(text "Play: ./ppplay tc8_474_4b.u32 22 4 32 6 247520 3600   (gap-free, 33.333 MS/s). TV: manual tune 474.000 MHz (UK ch 21), bandwidth 8 MHz." (at 25.4 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b18951b0-446d-4f79-abad-5133c6f30c1a"))
(text "3-bit mode on the same board: use GPIO23-25 (R2-R4 have the right 4:2:1 weights): ./ppplay tc8_474_3b.u32 23 3 30 6 198016 3600  (GPIO22 stays off)." (at 25.4 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "431c437b-185c-4066-ab74-f4e927ba0c2c"))
(text "Cable to the tuner only. UHF TV channels are broadcast spectrum: do not connect an aerial." (at 25.4 118.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dbb5f960-221a-4d45-b19f-8875791bce23"))
